      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "uh, today is December 1, 2024 10:46 PM, and I'm sitting and writing this
    text, not knowing why, well if anyone sees this... I want to say thank you for
    playing DD \u2661(>\u1D17\u2022), it's really cool, I think when this game comes
    out on steam, I'll completely forget about this text and that I wrote it at all
    and therefore because of this I'll most likely forget to delete it, it will be
    cool if later they talk to me about this text (>\u2A4A<)\r\neh I still have so
    much left to do, you can't even imagine, unfortunately now I'm making the game
    alone, okay, I'm off to work and listen to sad music, goodbye, dear player \u2593\u2592\u2591(\xB0\u25E1\xB0)\u2591\u2592\u2593"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
